  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Atoms for Africa&#x2019;s Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will enhance states&#x2019; ability to benefit from the peaceful use of nuclear technology by focusing on two pillars. The first is on building capacity &amp; greater awareness in Africa to enhance compliance with various non-proliferation obligations; and on safeguarding the security of nuclear material &amp; facilities in Africa against accidents, theft &amp; negligence. The second focuses on influencing African countries&#x2019; strategies on nuclear technology for development.</narrative>
  </description>
